    description: Some("Batman and Robin work from the Gotham subways out to Claw Island against Two-Face and the Riddler. Five gadgets go into each level — three fixed, two chosen at the Batcomputer — and the Riddler has stolen the Batcave\'s blueprints, so finding all four pieces of a set in a level unlocks that gadget for later."),
